# Friendship, home first: everyone Alice knows on the start screen, befriending there in one tap with Make friends, and a screen for each person.

SCREEN Home ABOUT Alice:
    QUESTIONS
    SHOW Alice: identity, person
    LIST Contacts: PERSONS WITH knows, friend OPENS Person
    Establish: Alice may establish an identity
    Make friends: Acquaint AND Befriend, Bob TYPED
    Acquaint: Alice and Bob may jointly come to know each other, Bob TYPED
    Befriend: Alice and Bob may jointly become friends, Bob FROM knows

SCREEN Person ABOUT Bob:
    SHOW Bob: knows, friend
    Befriend: Alice and Bob may jointly become friends
    Unfriend: Alice may end her friendship with Bob
    Introduce: Alice may introduce Carol to Bob, Carol FROM knows
    Introduce: Alice may introduce Bob to Carol, Carol FROM knows
